  "title": "Mutual Cover",
  "rules": [
    "Cargo carriers move on a 9 by 7 grid and may share cells; goals and hazard cells are actual native coordinates.",
    "Hazard lane j is active when (t+j)%4 is zero or one; standing there causes two damage before protection.",
    "Two-coin protection reduces each hit by one for three ticks. A one-coin adjacent escort reduces peer damage by one this tick.",
    "Repair uses one actor coin to heal an adjacent injured peer first, otherwise own cargo.",
    "Offers last three ticks and require range two. Acceptance locks two real coins from each member for six ticks.",
    "On first covered damage, the sole damaged member receives all four collateral coins; if both are damaged each receives two.",
    "Delivery or pact expiry without damage refunds two each. Settlement ends the pact; collateral cannot fund other actions while locked.",
    "Cargo delivers automatically at own goal if still intact; destruction and delivery make that actor inactive. Joint finish or H=64 absorbs."
  ],
